{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{!--
  A new message on a form submission, to everybody following it but the
  person who wrote it (Common/Server/Utils/Form/FormFollowUp): who wrote it,
  what they wrote, and the reader's own link to the request. The names and
  the title are printed through plainInfo or plainText - escaped - and the
  message as the HTML its Markdown was rendered into for email
  (Markdown.convertToHTML, which leaves nothing in it that acts on its own).
--}}

{{> EmailTitle title="New message on your request" }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat authorName " wrote on a request you follow, sent through " formName ".")}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Request" plainText=requestTitle }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Message" text=message }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Files" plainText=fileNames }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=requestUrl buttonText="Open the Request"}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=requestUrl linkLabel="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}

{{#if isSignInRequired}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Sign in with this email address to open it."}}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info="You get this email because you follow this request. To stop, open it and choose Stop following."}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> End this}}
